        {
          "no": 0,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "***** RETAIL BOOKING COMPLETION NOTES *****\n\nWhere was the booking made: In Store \n\nPassenger has been made aware of the importance of providing a contact number for use in Resort: YES\n\nMobile contact number in Client ID: YES\n\nDeparture date:27TH SEPTEMBER 2026\n\nFFP/FVC in Client ID: YES\n\n****************************************************\n\nPRE EXISTING MEDICAL CONDITIONS: NONE\nDoes the customer have any pre-existing medical conditions? Y or N\nIf Yes, have you filled out the Accessible Travel Services Form? \n\n****************************************************\n\nNumber of Adults:2\n\n* FLIGHTS *\n\nDepart Manchester International Sun 27 Sep 2026 14:00 Cabin ECONOMY CLASSIC VS 85 ( Operated by Virgin\nAtlantic )\nArrival Las Vegas Harry Reid International Apt Sun 27 Sep 2026 16:20\n\nDepart Los Angeles International Apt Wed 7 Oct 2026 07:00 Cabin MAIN CABIN DL 979 ( Operated by Delta Air\nLines )\nArrival New York J F Kennedy International Apt Wed 7 Oct 2026 15:25\n\nDepart New York J F Kennedy International Apt Sat 10 Oct 2026 20:05 Cabin MAIN CABIN DL 5980 ( Operated by\nVirgin Atlantic )\nArrival Manchester International Sun 11 Oct 2026 08:00\n\nHas the airlines seat booking policy been discussed?YES\n\n*****************************************************\n\n* HOTELS / VILLAS *\n\nHotel: Park MGM Las Vegas\n2 Adults, 0 Children, 0 Infants\nCheck In: Sun 27 Sep 2026 Check Out: Fri 2 Oct 2026\nDuration: 5 Nights\nMeal Plan: Room Only\nRoom Description\nPark MGM Two Queen - Double (44665210-510446-10-1) 1Room\n\nHotel: The Garland\n2 Adults, 0 Children, 0 Infants\nCheck In: Fri 2 Oct 2026 Check Out: Wed 7 Oct 2026\nDuration: 5 Nights\nMeal Plan: Room Only\nRoom Description\nDELUXE KING BED-COMP WIFI-PRIVATE BALCONY-FLAT\nSCREEN TV-FRIDGE-IN ROOM SAFE-COFFEE AND TEA MAKER-\n(D1K-VH2) 1Room\n\nHotel: RIU Plaza Manhattan Times Square\n2 Adults, 0 Children, 0 Infants\nCheck In: Wed 7 Oct 2026 Check Out: Sat 10 Oct 2026\nDuration: 3 Nights\nMeal Plan: Bed and Breakfast\n\nRoom Description\nDeluxe King (DLXK-1) 1Room\n\nHave Resort Fees, Local Fees and Taxes been advised? YES\n\n*****************************************************\n\n*RESORT TRANSFERS* \n\nOA IN RESORT\n\n*****************************************************\n\n* CAR HIRE *\n\n*NOT HAVING CAR WHILE IN VEGAS*\n\nCar: Chevrolet Tahoe or similar [1 Car ]\n2 Adults, 0 Children, 0 Infants\nPick up 7135 Gilespie Street, Las Vegas, Nv, 7135 Gilespie Street, Las Vegas, 89119-1256, Nv, Nevada Fri 2 Oct\n2026\nDrop off 9000 Airport Blvd, Los Angeles, Ca, Los Angeles Ap, 900450000, Ca, California Wed 7 Oct 2026\nInsurance Hertz Go\n\n******************************************************\n\nEXCURSIONS / EXTRAS / V-ROOM / VIRGIN EXPERIENCES\n\n(Universal 1 Day, 2nd Day Free Ticket)\n2 Adults, 0 Children, 0 Infants\nDate Sun 4 Oct 2026\n\n\n******************************************************\nT-BOX RE-CAP\nApplicable errata\u2019s advised: YES\nNames checked phonetically : YES\nItinerary recapped to pax: YES\n\n******************************************************\nTOTAL COST\nFinal cost agreed including cc charge if applicable: \u00A3 4,753.17\nDiscount used (not applicable to OODR bookings): NONE\n\n******************************************************\nDEPOSIT\nVHols standard deposit:\u00A3200\nApplicable hotel/experience charges:\u00A3196.19\nHas full deposit been taken? if no please explain why: YES\n\n***************************************************\n\nItinerary recapped to pax ensuring dates and hotel / transfers match: Y \n\nHave you advised the passenger to check the FCO website? Y \n\nHave you advised the passengers of any VISA or ESTA requirements if applicable? Y \n\nData protection advised: Y \n\n*Password* for other passengers: NONE",
          "displayName": "Kayleigh Hones",
          "dateModified": "2026-01-25T16:30:28",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~0",
          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 1,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "From:\u00A0Kayleigh Hones-Brown \u003Csanitized\u002B0780d03b@example.com\u003E\nSent:\u00A0Sunday, January 25, 2026 16:34\nTo:\u00A0sanitized\u002Ba522e0c8@example.com \u003Csanitized\u002Ba522e0c8@example.com\u003E\nSubject:\u00A0Its Booked - 7004639\n\u00A0\nHi Hannah \u0026 Callum,\n\nI hope you are all really excited now that everything is finalised.\u00A0\n\nThank you for booking with Virgin Holidays Liverpool. Your Virgin Holidays booking reference is 7004639. If you would like to download our app and look at your booking online this is the reference, you will need.\n\nPlease find attached your booking invoice. Have a good read through and make sure that everything is as agreed, if anything doesn\u0027t seem right, please let me know as soon as possible. Please take extra care to read through your room type, flight cabin class and any resort fee\u0027s that may be applicable to your booking.\u00A0\n\nPark MGM Las Vegas has a mandatory resort fee of $56.69 per room per night, plus tax which is payable locally. In order to settle this cost, you will need to pay at the hotel when you check in.\n\nThe City of Los Angeles has implemented a new tax called \u201CLA Hotel Worker Protection Ordinance Fee\u201D which costs $9.86 daily. daily. All reservations made on or after January 1, 2023 will be charged locally. They also have a daily Environmental Sustainability fee of $1.75 which will also be charged locally in resort for all bookings regardless of booking or travel dates\n\nRIU Plaza Manhattan Times Square have a mandatory resort fee of $29 per room per night, plus tax which is payable locally. In order to settle this cost, you will need to pay at the hotel when you check in.\n\nYou have no transfers on your booking as this will be cheaper and easier for you to do when you arrive in Las Vegas \u0026 New York.\n\nFor travel to the USA you are legally required to have a valid ESTA Visa. You can complete your ESTA\u0027s on the website below, we recommend that you do your ESTA visa\u0027s before your balance due date (05/07/2026)\u00A0Please make sure you only complete these when you have the passports you will be travelling with.\n\nhttps://esta.cbp.dhs.gov/\n\nWe don\u0027t sell travel insurance, but we do recommend that you take out travel insurance once you have booked your holiday to cover you from now up until your return.\n\nYour seat selections are available . As I mentioned these will be chargeable so if you do wish to select them you can make the payment directly to the airline alternatively if you sign up to Virgin Red/Virgin Flying Club (free of charge) you can make your seat selections 7 days prior to departure free of charge subject to availability.\u00A0 The reference you need to do this on Virgin Atlantics website is: EMTZYO\n\nhttps://www.virginatlantic.com/my-trips/search\n\nYour Internal ones are booked on Delta to view/change these please go to: https://www.delta.com/gb/en\n\nBooking Reference: H2NH2A\n\nI hope this makes sense if not please just let me know\n\nIf you need anything at all in between now and when you travel or have any questions, please feel free to pop in store or contact me via email.\n\nShortly after booking you will receive a survey via email about your experience. If you have been happy with my service, I would really appreciate if you were able to the time to complete it.\n\nWarmest Regards\n\nKayleigh\n",
          "displayName": "Kayleigh Hones",
          "dateModified": "2026-01-25T16:35:03",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~1",
          "noteId": 0
        }
      ],
