          "no": 20,
          "code": "Park MGM Las Vegas - Resort Fee/Parking 2024 and onwards",
          "description": "Park MGM Las Vegas - Resort Fee/Parking 2024 and onwards",
          "note": "Park MGM Las Vegas has a\u202Fmandatory resort fee of $56.69 per room per night, \nplus tax which is payable locally. In order to settle this cost, you will need to pay \nat the hotel when you check in.\n\nSelf-parking $20 and valet parking $40 per night which is payable locally, subject \nto change.\n\nThe resort fee is set by the accommodation provider, not the tour operator, so \nVirgin Atlantic Holidays cannot control the level of the fee, and it can change at \nany time.",
