          "no": 22,
          "code": "The Garland - LA Tax",
          "description": "The Garland - LA Tax",
          "note": "\u200BThe City of Los Angeles has implemented a new tax called \u201CLA Hotel Worker \nProtection Ordinance Fee\u201D which costs $9.86 daily.  daily.  All reservations made \non or after January 1, 2023 will be charged locally. \n\nThey also have a daily Environmental Sustainability fee of $1.75 which will also be \ncharged locally in resort for all bookings regardless of booking or travel dates.",
